vfs: add --vfs-pin to pin paths from the start

Pins added with vfs/pin are kept in memory, and the cache cleaner runs
as soon as the cache is created, so after a restart it could remove
pinned files (older than --vfs-cache-max-age, or over
--vfs-cache-max-size) before they were pinned again. --vfs-pin, which
can be repeated, pins paths before the cleaner starts.

